Lighthouse_3F_Text_Boss_Intro::
	.string "You climbed all this way? The lamp\n"
	.string "never lights for visitors. Only for\p"
	.string "ships that left long ago.$"

Lighthouse_3F_Text_Boss_Defeat::
	.string "The lamp... it turned the right\n"
	.string "way. Just once.$"

Lighthouse_3F_Text_Boss_After::
	.string "Go on, take it. The light was never\n"
	.string "mine.$"

Lighthouse_3F_Text_Boss_NoRoom::
	.string "Your BAG is full. Make room, then\n"
	.string "come back.$"
